        344.74627685546875,
        500.04522705078125,
        353.8720397949219
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "positioning of a number of randomly deployed sensors, according to some reference deﬁned by a set of anchor",
      "bbox": [
        46.4849967956543,
        357.2025146484375,
        500.0284118652344,
        366.3282775878906
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "nodes for which the positions are known a priori. The new algorithm, while achieving a better or similar performance,",
